# VetBuddy Benefit Vault research ledger, batch 07 (WV, WI, WY, DC, PR, VI, MP, GU, NM)
# Format: CAT|TITLE|GROUPS|RULE|ELIGIBLE|VALUE|URL  (see data/research/RESEARCH_LOG.md)
# Every row is UNVERIFIED until a named reviewer checks the URL (G1). Pages fetched 2026-10-27.
# NM comes from the MyAirForceBenefits page (same DoD benefits library); the MyArmyBenefits NM page could not be reached.
# American Samoa has no State/Territory Benefits page on either site and no official territorial page was found: no block (SOURCE_NOT_AVAILABLE).

